SUMMARY:Nateland's Brian Bates Makes His Comedy Attic Debut!
LOCATION:Bloomington
DESCRIPTION:Comedian Brian Bates worked for nearly 20 years in corporate Am
 erica until at the age of 43\, he gave up his day job to pivot into a caree
 r as a stand-up comedian. Since then\, the Nashville based comic has been t
 ouring the country performing at comedy clubs\, theaters\, corporate events
 \, and churches.\n\nBrian has released two Dry Bar Comedy specials\, titled
   Uber Important  and  Hello Folks . His latest special\, titled  Worri
 ed \, was released in July 2026 on the Nateland Entertainment YouTube chann
 el.\n\nAs an originating member of the highly popular  The Nateland Podcas
 t \, Brian served as a host and producer during the show’s six-year run. 
 He now works with fellow comedians Aaron Weber and Dusty Slay as one of the
  hosts and producers of  The Public Figures Podcast \, heard by thousands 
 of listeners each week.\n\nHe performs regularly on the legendary Grand Ole
  Opry show and can be heard frequently on Pure Comedy Channel 98 on SiriusX
 M satellite radio.\n\nIn addition to stand-up comedy\, Brian made his actin
 g debut appearing in two episodes of the 2022 Amazon sitcom  Sprung . He m
 ost recently appeared in the 2026 Nate Bargatze movie  The Breadwinner .\n
 More info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/nateland-s-brian-bate
